 6900 XT (radeonsi, navi21, LLVM 20.1.8, DRM 3.64, 6.16.1-arch1-1) - AMD Ryzen 9 5950X 16-Core Processor (32 threads) - 62.68 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nOn rare occasions I stumble upon D-Bus issues with Godot in Linux and ThreadSanitizer detected data races when initializing it:\n\n- [SUMMARY: ThreadSanitizer: data race /opt/godot/platform/linuxbsd/dbus-so_wrap.c:953:61 in initialize_dbus](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21928015/dbus-so_wrap_data_race_line_953.txt)\n- [SUMMARY: ThreadSanitizer: data race /opt/godot/platform/linuxbsd/dbus-so_wrap.c:1121:65 in initialize_dbus](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21928016/dbus-so_wrap_data_race_line_1121.txt)\n- [SUMMARY: ThreadSanitizer: data race /opt/godot/platform/linuxbsd/dbus-so_wrap.c:1617:69 in initialize_dbus](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21928017/dbus-so_wrap_data_race_line_1617.txt)\n- [SUMMARY: ThreadSanitizer: data race /opt/godot/platform/linuxbsd/dbus-so_wrap.c:1649:70 in initialize_dbus](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21928018/dbus-so_wrap_data_race_line_1649.txt)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nRun a build with ThreadSanitizer enabled in Linux on an empty project.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nAn empty or new project suffices.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/re